# Stack

- `apps/web` — only deployable Worker (Vite SPA + `src/worker.ts`)
- `apps/api` — Hono library: schema, routes, R2 — imported by the web Worker
- `packages/shared` — Zod schemas / shared types
- React 19 functional components + hooks; Tailwind v4 tokens in `apps/web/src/index.css` only
- Factories: `createDb(env)`, `createAuth(env)`, `createApp()` — never module-level env
- Better Auth at `/api/auth`; admin routes use `requireAdmin` + `withOwnerRls(db, session.user.id, …)`
- First-party analytics via `/api/analytics/beacon` + admin summary (no third-party SaaS)
